    "text": "By Ale Espinosa ,\n4 hours ago KANSAS CITY, Mo. (KCTV) - Jason Mendez and his team opened a vegan-Mexican restaurant concept before the World Cup, betting on neighborhood energy. Staying open in 2026 is its own kind of math, according to Mendez. “People’s expendable income, it... it trickles downhill,” said Mendez, part owner of Madrina Vegana.... Read full article",
